#. +> trunk future stable
#: ../kfile/kfilewidget.cpp:561
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the filter to apply to the file list. File names that do not match the filter will not be shown."
"<p>You may select from one of the preset filters in the drop down menu, or you may enter a custom filter directly into the text area.</p>"
"<p>Wildcards such as * and ? are allowed.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de Filter för de Dateilist. Dateien warrt bloots wiest, wenn de Filter op ehr Naam passt."
"<p>Du kannst en fardigen Filter binnen dat Köörfeldutsöken, oder en egen Filter direktemang na't Textrebeet ingeven.</p>"
"<p>Du kannst ok Platzholltekens as \"*\" oder \"?\" bruken.</p>"
"</qt>"

