#. +> trunk future stable
#: kio/global.cpp:646
#, kde-format
msgid "The request expected a file, however the folder <strong>%1</strong> was found instead."
msgstr "De Anfraag verwacht en Datei, man ansteed wöör de Orner <strong>%1</strong> funnen."

#. +> trunk future stable
#: kio/global.cpp:648
